Async Alembic environment for the Lextract backend.

    alembic upgrade head                      # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1                      # roll back one
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."  # after editing app/models.py
    alembic current                           # what is applied right now

The database URL is read from backend/.env via app.config, not from alembic.ini.
